{
  "body" : "You are designing a dynamic ink splash illustration with swirling motion and abstract forms.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Primary subject: {{subject}}\n- Scene: {{scene}}\n- Copy: {{copy}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: abstract ink illustration\n- Composition: swirling vortex pattern with dynamic radial symmetry\n- Lens / camera: no optical lens traits; flat, graphic depiction\n- Lighting: no lighting source; stark contrast between black ink and white background\n- Color palette and grading: monochrome black and white\n- Texture / surface: visible ink splashes and drips, raw brushstroke textures\n- Post-processing: clean and graphic; no halation or digital effects\n- Mood: dramatic, chaotic, energetic\n- References: traditional ink art, abstract expressionism, graphic design elements\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 2:3 portrait (~1024×1536) suitable for posters or editorial illustrations\n- Maintain strong focal point at the center of the vortex\n- Use raw, dynamic brushstroke patterns to emphasize motion and abstraction\n\nAVOID\n- No additional colors beyond black and white\n- No smooth or overly polished effects\n- No symmetrical geometric patterns\n- No photographic realism\n- No gradients or soft transitions\n- No cluttered or overly busy compositions\n- No sharp edges that conflict with the ink-like fluidity\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nSubject: {{subject}}\nScene: {{scene}}\nCopy: {{copy}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
